    <briefdescription>
<para>A spherical video file contains surfaces that need to be mapped onto a sphere. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>Depending on how the frame was converted, a different distortion transformation or surface recomposition function needs to be applied before the video should be mapped and displayed. </para>
